stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    state "return-pending" as return_pending

    [*] --> requested: renter sends request
    requested --> declined: owner declines
    requested --> approved: owner approves
    requested --> cancelled: either side cancels
    approved --> cancelled: either side cancels before payment
    approved --> paid: renter pays fee + 10% + escrow fee + deposit
    paid --> active: renter confirms handover with photo
    note right of active
        Owner gets the rental fee 48 h after handover.
        The deposit stays held until the return.
    end note
    active --> return_pending: item returned with photos
    active --> overdue: due date passes (job)
    overdue --> return_pending: returned late, late fee from deposit
    overdue --> missing: more than 7 days late (job)
    return_pending --> released: owner confirms, or 48 h with no dispute
    return_pending --> disputed: owner files within 48 h
    disputed --> resolved: admin decides, owner gets at most the deposit
    released --> [*]
    resolved --> [*]
    missing --> [*]: full deposit to owner
    declined --> [*]
    cancelled --> [*]
